        "zh": "执行清单步骤 `project_output`，仅将既有确定性评估结果投影为可验收的规范记录、标量指标和完整性字段。",
        "en": "Run manifest step `project_output` to project the existing deterministic assessment into acceptance-ready canonical records, scalar metrics, and completeness fields."
      },
      "operations": {
        "zh": [
          "读取 `evaluate` 的结构化规则结果及已经校验的运行输入，不再次访问 SAP。",
          "按公司代码、控制范围、成本中心、会计年度和期间范围生成一条规范汇总记录；未知金额保持 null，不补零。",
          "分别输出查询源、证据和业务完整性，并保留计划证据缺失等限制代码。",
          "用同一组规范记录和标量指标构建结构化业务报告。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Read the structured `evaluate` result and validated run input without accessing SAP again.",
          "Build one canonical summary record for company code, controlling area, cost center, fiscal year, and period range; keep unknown amounts null instead of substituting zero.",
          "Expose source, evidence, and business completeness separately while preserving limitation codes such as missing plan evidence.",
          "Build the structured business report from the same canonical records and scalar metrics."
        ]
      },
