      "recordScope": "records",
      "recordDefinition": "每次运行生成一条成本中心期间汇总记录，由公司代码、控制范围、成本中心、会计年度、起始期间和结束期间唯一标识；币种和业务状态来自已取得的结构化证据与确定性评估。 / One summary record per run, uniquely identified by company code, controlling area, cost center, fiscal year, period from, and period to; currency and business status come from collected structured evidence and deterministic assessment.",
      "scopeDefinition": "纳入严格按必填输入过滤并由完整分页的 Embedded OData 或经条件门禁验证的只读 ADT 补证返回的成本中心主数据、实际费用和指定计划类别的计划费用。排除范围外成本中心、年度或期间；不执行币种换算，不把缺失计划、截断或失败读取当作零。 / Include cost-center master, actual expense, and the selected planning category returned by fully paged Embedded OData or condition-gated validated read-only ADT evidence under the required filters. Exclude other cost centers, fiscal years, or periods; perform no currency conversion, and never treat missing plan, truncated, or failed reads as zero.",
      "factDefinitions": {
        "company_code": "经输入 Schema 校验并用于实际和计划读取过滤的公司代码；它定义本次汇总范围，不从缺失证据推断。 / Schema-validated company code applied to actual and plan read filters; it defines this summary scope and is never inferred from missing evidence.",
        "controlling_area": "经输入 Schema 校验并用于成本中心主数据读取过滤的控制范围。 / Schema-validated controlling area applied to the cost-center master filter.",
        "cost_center": "经输入 Schema 校验并同时用于主数据、实际和计划读取过滤的成本中心。 / Schema-validated cost center applied to master, actual, and plan filters.",
        "fiscal_year": "经输入 Schema 校验并用于实际会计年度与计划分类账会计年度过滤的会计年度。 / Schema-validated fiscal year applied to actual fiscal-year and planning-ledger fiscal-year filters.",
        "period_from": "经输入 Schema 校验并作为实际和计划期间下界的起始期间。 / Schema-validated inclusive lower period bound applied to actual and plan reads.",
        "period_to": "经输入 Schema 校验并作为实际和计划期间上界的结束期间。 / Schema-validated inclusive upper period bound applied to actual and plan reads.",
        "business_status": "确定性规则基于完整性、主数据冻结、计划可用性、币种可比性及阈值结果生成；只允许 normal、attention 或 capability_blocked。 / Deterministic status derived from completeness, master-data blocks, plan availability, currency comparability, and threshold results; allowed values are normal, attention, or capability_blocked.",
        "currency": "实际和计划证据中的唯一公司代码币种；缺失或多币种不可比时为 null。 / The single company-code currency evidenced by actual and plan rows; null when absent or when multiple currencies are not comparable."
