        "plan_amount": "对本次范围和计划类别内规则消费的计划费用证据行各计一次后求和；存在完整计划行时可为 0，计划证据缺失或查询源不完整时为 null。 / Sum each planned-expense evidence row consumed for the selected scope and planning category once; complete evidenced rows may sum to 0, while missing plan evidence or an incomplete source is null.",
        "variance_amount": "仅在计划证据存在时计算 actual_amount 减 plan_amount；无计划证据或查询源不完整时为 null，不补零。 / Compute actual_amount minus plan_amount only when plan evidence exists; null, never zero-filled, when plan evidence is missing or the source is incomplete.",
