      "businessStatusDefinition": "capability_blocked 表示计划或其他必需证据缺失，不能形成确定结论；attention 表示证据已取得但存在主数据冻结、币种不可比、计划基数为零或差异达到阈值；normal 表示证据完整且未触发这些规则。 / capability_blocked means required plan or other evidence is missing; attention means evidence was obtained but a posting block, currency mismatch, zero plan base, or threshold breach was found; normal means evidence is complete and none of those rules fired.",
